    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="8" relname="background">Bears are not uncommon in Ontario.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="9" relname="span">As campers, you should be careful in the wilderness.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="2" relname="motivation">Last year several nightly attacks on campers have been reported.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="9" relname="motivation">Also, there were a number of unpleasant mountain lion encounters.</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="6" relname="span">So, it is important not to keep meat in the tent and not to sleep in the clothes worn for a barbecue.</segment>
        <group id="6" type="span"/>
        <group id="7" type="span" parent="5" relname="motivation"/>
        <group id="8" type="span" parent="7" relname="span"/>
        <group id="9" type="span" parent="8" relname="span"/>
    </body>
